Third-party attributions (see README.md for details):

* Anime4K shaders, weights and algorithm by bloc97, MIT licensed
  (https://github.com/bloc97/Anime4K). The .fx files in shaders/ are ports of
  that work; the trained weights remain bloc97's.
* The port follows the structure of Magpie's HLSL effects by Blinue
  (https://github.com/Blinue/Magpie).
* Runtime filtering uses vkBasalt by DadSchoorse and contributors
  (https://github.com/DadSchoorse/vkBasalt), a separate project used
  unmodified at run time.
